  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(a x^2+b y^2+2 h x y+2 g x+2 f y+c=0\\)\nrepresents ellipse if \\(\\mathrm{h}^2-a b  < 0\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& 3 x^2+12 y^2-4 x+4 y-1=0 \\\\\n& h=0, a=3, b=12 \\\\\n& h^2-a b < 0\n\\end{aligned}\\)"
  }
